ID: harness
Category: harness
Check: isolation__left_no_trace

A unit test of the builder checks out another commit in slot app-wt1 of the pool. It runs in the
unit layer's environment (cargo's, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null, no EMAIL), not the int sandbox's,
so git names its fallback identity. Tests the p0r4-identity-scope rule on the layer where a
builder's test most likely reaches the pool. Machine specific: the path is a fake pool under the
verifier's temporary HOME, never the real pool.

diff --git a/crates/wt/src/main.rs b/crates/wt/src/main.rs
